      "id": "zulu-000002",
      "culture": "zulu",
      "text": "Inkomo kayibulawa ngokuyithemba.",
      "translation_en": "An ox is not killed by trusting it (you must act, not just rely on faith).",
      "meaning": "Effort and action are required; wishing alone is not enough.",
